/-
P3 (DESIGN.md §9), invariant line G1 (INV-PLAN §4, ut7): **`P3 N` (UtInv'' and
the IRQ-node fact) kept by the cap-writing ancestors that need no decode fact**
(generated by proofs/scratch/ut7/mkun.sh from ut3's generator, family
`IK (P3 N)`, prefix `un`): deletion (`cap_revoke` by the least fixed point over
`cap_delete`), IPC incl. the cap transfer, faults, timeouts and budget, the TCB
invocations, plus the combinators with monadic parameters. Leaves (SpecInvUtO2):
the `UK` frames (`p3_of_uk`), `cap_delete_one`, `rec_del` / `cap_delete`, the TCB
installs (`p3_installTcbCap` / `p3_checkCapAt_ins` at the literal slot numbers),
`do_normal_transfer`. The performs that need a decode fact (untyped, CNode, IRQ
control / handler, IO ports, ASID control / pool, the VSpace performs,
DeriveSubframe) are hand-written.
-/
import Fl4Proofs.P3.SpecInvUtO2
open Classical

namespace Fl4Proofs.P3.SInvU
open Fl4Spec Fl4Proofs.P3.SInv

noncomputable section

set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000
